+ 1% per 200 ) and slows them by 60% for 1s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ebde3d94865d5d05527b4becf8099d61.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":5210,"name":"Curse of Crow","description":"Pharsa unleashes a blast of magic at the target location, dealing 300 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and marking them for 4s.\n\nWhen Pharsa hits a marked enemy with a Basic Attack or active skill, the mark is consumed, stunning them for 1s.\n\nMarked enemies will have their positions revealed.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f742fccb6bbc9436b3085a1ee4b740f7.png","video":null,"cd":8.0,"cost":60.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":5220,"name":"Energy Impact","description":"Pharsa releases magic energy in the target direction, dealing 475 (+145% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dcf364fc10b2a3ee13ba23a6d56f7987.png","video":null,"cd":6.5,"cost":60.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":5230,"name":"Feathered Air Strike","description":"Passive: Each level-up reduces Spiritual Unity's interval by 1s.\nActive: Pharsa takes flight for 8s and bombards the target area, dealing 530 (+160% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies within. This skill can be cast up to 4 times during the flight.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f0d9ce0152491c148821703d1e31d802.png","video":null,"cd":36.0,"cost":120.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":5250,"name":"Wings by Wings","description":"Pharsa turns into mist and wraps around Verri, gaining 150% extra Movement Speed (decays over time) and the ability to fly over terrain for 5s.\n\nThis state ends immediately when she is controlled or uses a Basic Attack or skill.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_566a1f86bd9177eb7b75f0fb0a0c762c.png","video":null,"cd":23.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Morph","rgb":"97,127,198"},{"name":"Speed Up","rgb":"79,156,184"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Pharsa is best with heroes who can CC the enemy so that her skills can hit them. Atlas and Franco are good examples of this.","heroes":[{"id":93,"name":"Atlas","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d974ac796678180ff8724b88e192898b.png"},{"id":10,"name":"Franco","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9bed3c0095335606e0ce616c6e5a8553.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Pharsa can deal high burst damage from a very long range. A great counter to enemy back-row heroes with poor Mobility, such as Layla, Hanabi and Xavier.","heroes":[{"id":18,"name":"Layla","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b2b38e9406ea0de0b866db7674feea0f.png"},{"id":60,"name":"Hanabi","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8a9c1966feb34e85d7bdcc1ed01ffb5d.png"},{"id":115,"name":"Xavier","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_df0a8dfc494f85ed9bbc4512cc1e5d3c.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Pharsa should beware of any displacement ability skill. Heroes like Franco, Zilong and Minsitthar can easily interrupt Pharsa's Ultimate.","heroes":[{"id":10,"name":"Franco","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9bed3c0095335606e0ce616c6e5a8553.png"},{"id":16,"name":"Zilong","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9db57da4f0daef6d432676e4f19101ed.png"},{"id":74,"name